BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SF Philharmonic Plays Free Beach Concert (SF)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T173000
DTSTAMP:20261101T123812Z
UID:funcheap-20261101-sfphilharmonicplaysfreeb
CATEGORIES:concert,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-philharmonic-plays-free-beach-conce
 rt-sf/\nLocation: san francisco\nPrice: Free\nCategories: concert\, free\n
 Source: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nThe San Francisco Philharmonic performs 
 Tchaikovsky’s 1812 Overture at Pacheco Surf Perch on San Francisco’s U
 pper Great Highway. The 30-minute orchestral performance is presented by a
  group focused on cultural enrichment\, music education\, and creating per
 formance opportunities for women and POC artists. Original Event Descripti
 on: Join the SF Philharmonic at the the Pacheco Surf Perch for the iconic 
 performance of Tchaikovsky’s iconic overture. San Francisco Philharmonic
  is an orchestral group dedicated to cultural enrichment\, music education
  and creating a performance platform for women and POC artists to showcase
  their talents. Tchaikovsky’s 1812 Overture with the SF Philharmonic Sun
 day\, November 1\, 2026 5:00 PM 5:30 PM Pacheco Surf Perch 2000 Upper Grea
 t Highway San Francisco\, California\, 94116United States (map)
LOCATION:san francisco
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-philharmonic-plays-free-beach-concert-sf/
END:VEVENT
